            </note>
            <note corresp="#d490-f3" n="3" xml:id="d490-f3-content">
                <p>In telegram 5314 from Kinshasa, February 18, Blake reported that he gave Mobutu the substance of the points in this telegram, and that
                        Mobutu was obviously pleased.
                    (National Archives, RG 59, Central Files
                    1967–69, POL 30 THE CONGO)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
